sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]

    Note over App, Node: Allowed states: standby.<br>Calling outside standby asserts on the Node.<br>Fire-and-forget, no response callback.<br>Pre-conditions: when enabling, call SetIdentityAddress first<br>so future bonds capture the intended identity.

    alt Enable privacy
        App->>Node: GapCentral.SetPrivacyMode(true)
        Note over App: The controller generates<br>and rotates a resolvable private address<br>based on the local IRK.
    else Disable privacy
        App->>Node: GapCentral.SetPrivacyMode(false)
        Note over App: The central uses its configured identity address<br>(see SetIdentityAddress).
    end
